{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 15630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 10710, "text": "Well, Bull's been at it for two hours.\nThat is, two hours of uninterrupted"}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 19970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 15630, "text": "drawing. Actually, it's only been 90\nminutes, sir. Oh, yeah, he did lose a"}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 21670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 19970, "text": "hour getting the crayon box open."}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 27510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 26510, "text": "Well,"}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 30030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 28710, "text": "we certainly seem to enjoy his work."}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 32990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 30570, "text": "That or it's one of those Flintstones\nflashbacks."}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 36429, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 35510, "text": "Hi, guys."}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 37409, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 36430, "text": "Hi, Bull."}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 41550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 37410, "text": "Bull, Bull, Bull, Bull, Bull, what the\nheck have you been sketching, you big"}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 43030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 41550, "text": "post -impressionist lugget?"}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 46090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 44170, "text": "It's a cover illustration for the book\nI've written."}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 51330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 49330, "text": "The man wrote a book?"}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 54170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 53170, "text": "Elephant idea."}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 59770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 56770, "text": "Manhattan City College is having a\nchildren's book contest."}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 62460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 60440, "text": "All the entries are going to be judged\nby school kids."}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 63900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 62700, "text": "How old are these kids, Bull?"}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 65280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 64200, "text": "Eight, nine."}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 71820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 66640, "text": "Somehow the idea of writing for tiny\nlittle undeveloped minds seems right for"}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 72820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 71820, "text": "me."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 76240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 73980, "text": "I don't think we need to embellish on\nthat."}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 82460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 77320, "text": "The winner, whomever that tall, shaven\n-headed man or woman"}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 87200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 82460, "text": "might be, gets a publishing contract."}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 89620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 87700, "text": "Hey, so what did you draw for the cover?"}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 94870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 90110, "text": "A little ducky? Oh, I love little\nduckies. There's Daffy and Daisy and"}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 96970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 94870, "text": "and... Dr."}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 98190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 97190, "text": "Death."}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 146060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 145060, "text": "Three were right."}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 149660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 146380, "text": "About what, Bull? It could be so many\nthings."}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 154040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 151460, "text": "My cover drawing was all wrong, so I\ndrew a new one."}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 155360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 154360, "text": "Well, let's have a look."}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 157920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 156920, "text": "What do you think?"}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 164260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 158380, "text": "Well, Bull, now, I'm no historian, but I\ndon't think that Duck took part in the"}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 165500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 164260, "text": "ancient Roman orgies."}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 169820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 167500, "text": "Those suckers sure look happy, don't\nthey?"}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 176750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 174350, "text": "Lady, I'm a normal American male."}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 179450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 177270, "text": "You're three normal American males."}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 187130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 181670, "text": "What's our problem here? I was violated.\nHey, I was just checking our pipes."}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 191110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 188650, "text": "Matt? He's with the gas company, sir."}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 192630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 191470, "text": "Peeping Tom charge."}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 194670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 193530, "text": "And the lady is?"}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 196010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 195010, "text": "The pee -pee."}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 207880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 204040, "text": "claims he was merely trying to check\nMiss Brody's meter when she, quote,"}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 211800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 207880, "text": "her soapy, nude, glistening body at me."}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 215300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 214300, "text": "Read that back to me."}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 217480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 216480, "text": "Man."}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 219320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 218060, "text": "You saved me a copy."}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 222840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 221160, "text": "Yeah, I know. I swear."}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 224900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 223180, "text": "This woman was bouncing."}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 226700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 225660, "text": "She's shimmying."}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 229260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 227700, "text": "She even threw me one of these."}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 236090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 231460, "text": "Let the record show. that the defendant\ndid pelvic things."}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 238950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 237530, "text": "This is outrageous."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 242510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 239470, "text": "He had his nose pressed up against my\nwindow."}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 245110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 242770, "text": "Yeah, well, why don't you tell him what\nyou had pressed up against it?"}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 246970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 245970, "text": "All right, people."}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 250750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 247150, "text": "What I've got here, I've got no\nevidence. I've got no corroborating"}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 255130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 250990, "text": "I don't even have any suggestion of\ncriminal intent. So I would like to"}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 259790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 255130, "text": "this one off as an unfortunate incident.\nThat is, if, uh... Mr. Dobbs here can"}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 263450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 259790, "text": "assure the court that he has no past\nhistory of unusual sexual behavior?"}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 265390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 263910, "text": "My wife's from the old school."}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 270990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 268630, "text": "And you promise to try to keep your eyes\non your job?"}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 272229, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 271250, "text": "I'll do my best."}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 273230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 272230, "text": "Best."}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 276670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 274710, "text": "That's all we can ask. Case dismissed."}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 280530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 279530, "text": "That's it?"}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 282770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 281030, "text": "Well, it was fun while it lasted,\nthough, huh?"}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 286550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 285550, "text": "Well..."}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 290630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 287690, "text": "no place for propriety in this day and\nage. Goodbye."}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 294810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 290990, "text": "Do you"}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 303370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 294810, "text": "have"}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 304370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 303370, "text": "the time?"}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 307310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 306210, "text": "Time for what?"}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 314070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 309510, "text": "You know, I've been undressing you with\nmy eyes."}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 321390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 319690, "text": "Lucky for me, I've got clean shorts on."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 326850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 324630, "text": "Ever fool around at work?"}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 331010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 327590, "text": "No. I mean, that is, not with another\nperson."}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 338510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 337330, "text": "Warm, Dan."}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 341450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 340050, "text": "Are you warm?"}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 348230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 345730, "text": "Let's find some place where we can be."}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 350320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 349320, "text": "Alone."}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 351920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 350920, "text": "Now."}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 354540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 353540, "text": "Now?"}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 358860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 355820, "text": "No, well, no, I can't now. I've got a\njob. I've got responsibilities."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 363280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 361440, "text": "I've got fresh batteries in my\nbriefcase."}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 367620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 365660, "text": "You stand right there. Do not move a\nnerve."}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 371480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 368120, "text": "Is this free?"}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 386310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 382830, "text": "urgent personal nature have arisen and\nregrettably forced me to ask for a"}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 388590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 387210, "text": "Fact or money, Dan?"}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 393570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 392490, "text": "Oh, I'm hurt."}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 396370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 395370, "text": "Oh, I'm offended."}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 398350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 396710, "text": "Did you jump to such an assumption?"}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 402110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 398650, "text": "Has it ever occurred to you I could be\nin the midst of a dire personal tragedy?"}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 404790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 403790, "text": "Sex."}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 411370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 407790, "text": "Dan, give your appliances the afternoon\noff."}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 420170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 419170, "text": "Shannon."}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 421910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 420910, "text": "Yep."}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 426950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 422170, "text": "I am Sidney Shook, professor of\nliterature at Manhattan City College. I"}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 430050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 426950, "text": "charge of the children's book contest.\nDid you get my entry?"}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 431650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 430650, "text": "Oh, yes."}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 438350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 432950, "text": "It was the most vile, offensive,\nnauseatingly horrid collection of"}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 440250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 438350, "text": "have ever seen put to paper."}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 442650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 441650, "text": "Did I win?"}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 446870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 444990, "text": "Excuse me, guys. What's going on?"}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 452180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 447350, "text": "Sir, Mr. Shoup critiqued my children's\nbook. It was ghastly, nightmarish,"}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 453180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 452180, "text": "apocalyptic."}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 455220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 454220, "text": "Did he win?"}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 458060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 457020, "text": "Excuse me."}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 463620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 458700, "text": "Bull Shannon is the sweetest, kindest,\ngentlest man I know. I cannot believe"}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 467620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 463620, "text": "that he would write... Puff, the flesh\n-eating dragon?"}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 473740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 469420, "text": "Needless to say... our kiddie panel of\njudges has been wrapped with nightmares."}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 477420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 474120, "text": "Little Stevie actually strangled his\nimaginary friend."}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 480540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 479000, "text": "You are a disgrace."}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 483240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 481160, "text": "You're a menace. You're a monster."}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 485320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 484320, "text": "Did he win?"}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 491780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 487700, "text": "Well, in view of these circumstances, I\nguess it would really be proper for us"}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 492780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 491780, "text": "to call... Yes?"}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 495940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 494060, "text": "A short... Yes?"}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 509480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 504840, "text": "might say, if you'll excuse me, I have\nan imaginary funeral to attend."}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 515340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 512780, "text": "Well, maybe this story wasn't such a\ngood idea."}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 518419, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 516260, "text": "You mean you really think it's scary for\nkids?"}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 521539, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 518640, "text": "Kids, adults, dead people."}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 526220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 523919, "text": "What? I didn't mean to scare anyone."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 530520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 526600, "text": "Well, we all know what a big heart you\nhave and what a swell guy you are, and"}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 532800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 530520, "text": "that's why it's our job to let you know\nthat..."}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 536020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 533920, "text": "Flaming toddlers is wrong."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 543200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 538460, "text": "So what everybody is saying is that I\nscared little kids."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 546000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 543920, "text": "Little defenseless kids."}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 554740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 551840, "text": "What a low, sick, rotten thing to do."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 556940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 555940, "text": "It's true."}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 558520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 557300, "text": "I am a monster."}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 590830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 587630, "text": "I guess we're going to have to feel our\nway around."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 598630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 593610, "text": "Let the games begin."}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 606090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 603750, "text": "You ever do this before?"}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 621890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 620110, "text": "You touch me, we touch each other."}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 660600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 659560, "text": "about the parakeets, huh?"}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 665000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 663200, "text": "I'll never use my blender again."}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 670920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 667500, "text": "Well, you gotta admit, he's got a\ncertain kind of flair. It's kind of like"}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 672720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 670920, "text": "Mother Goose meets the Terminator."}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 674900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 673900, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 677480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 675240, "text": "Your Honor. Mac, any news about Bull?"}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 680160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 677880, "text": "Yep. He was just taken to the hospital."}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 682840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 680460, "text": "What? He was just taken to the hospital."}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 687920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 684680, "text": "Apparently, he started shouting\nsomething about how he scared innocent"}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 691970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 688120, "text": "Then he exploded. in a blind rage and\ndestroy that corridor wall."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 694630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 692670, "text": "What goes through that man's head?"}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 697150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 695430, "text": "Apparently not concrete or steel."}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 727470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 724430, "text": "and he shouldn't be allowed to be around\nnormal people, that he should be in a"}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 728470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 727470, "text": "cave or something."}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 731850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 728510, "text": "Let's hit all his regular haunts. I'll\ncheck out his apartment. I'll check up"}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 732850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 731850, "text": "the roof."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 735990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 732910, "text": "I'll check every bar, disco, and singles\njoint in the city."}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 738550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 736450, "text": "Who doesn't hang out in those kinds of\nplaces?"}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 741790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 739050, "text": "You go check where you want, and I'll go\ncheck where I want."}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 756470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 755470, "text": "Use this."}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 762750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 758310, "text": "Oh, Danny, can't you forgive a girl a\nlittle?"}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 764130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 763130, "text": "A little?"}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 769530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 764670, "text": "For what? Taking me to the peak of\necstasy and then leave me dangling?"}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 778050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 774050, "text": "Please, Dan, give me a second chance."}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 779950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 778950, "text": "Ha!"}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 783570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 780770, "text": "Give me one good reason why I should\ngive you a second chance."}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 797650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 796590, "text": "Okay, well, thank you."}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 800890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 799270, "text": "Bull's not at the amusement park."}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 803010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 801890, "text": "They miss him, though."}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 806450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 804670, "text": "He's the most popular ride they got."}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 812410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 808530, "text": "Bully the dragon looked like something\nout of our world, an extinct creature"}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 813410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 812410, "text": "from another time."}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 816030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 815030, "text": "That's it."}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 817470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 816170, "text": "That's what? Read that again."}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 821930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 818150, "text": "Bully the dragon looked like something\nout of our world, an extinct creature"}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 822930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 821930, "text": "from another time."}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 824670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 823670, "text": "Bully the dragon."}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 827510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 826030, "text": "Bull the dragon."}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 836770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 830690, "text": "And so, Bully the dragon went off to be\nwith others of his kind at the dragon"}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 838130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 836770, "text": "jamboree."}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 846370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 845290, "text": "See you later."}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 848470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 847170, "text": "Where are you going?"}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 850830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 848710, "text": "I'm going to the dragon jamboree."}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 894310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 889570, "text": "Not the small... Occipital. Thank you."}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 897910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 896910, "text": "Anything else?"}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 900410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 898150, "text": "Yes. Please don't kill us."}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 903670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 902670, "text": "Okay."}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 905670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 904670, "text": "Let's go, Jimmy."}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 909950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 908470, "text": "Homo sapiens, huh?"}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 917470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 915050, "text": "Sometimes I wish I was made of stone,\ntoo."}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 924500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 923400, "text": "These, uh, friends of yours?"}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 927480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 926480, "text": "In a way."}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 932680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 927860, "text": "Whenever I need somebody to talk to\nreally bad, I come down here and rap"}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 933680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 932680, "text": "the statues."}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 935780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 934480, "text": "Do they ever answer you?"}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 939680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 937940, "text": "I'm tormented, Harry, not crazy."}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 947700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 943400, "text": "Well, listen, I know that you've been\nthrough a wall."}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 953030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 951530, "text": "work this out, Guy. We always do."}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 954970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 953930, "text": "What's there to work out?"}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 957950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 955490, "text": "I'm a monster, and I might as well learn\nto live with it."}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 961530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 959950, "text": "Is he always like this?"}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 964950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 963950, "text": "Don't answer that."}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 970770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 965990, "text": "Bull, now for one thing, who ever said\nyou were a monster?"}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 973230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 972230, "text": "Look at me, Harry."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 976090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 973550, "text": "I didn't even have to dress up for\nHalloween as a kid."}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 979650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 978090, "text": "They'd say, great mask."}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 980950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 979950, "text": "Let me guess."}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 982580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 981280, "text": "Frankenstein, Phantom of the Opera?"}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 986320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 983860, "text": "Kids can be cruel. This was my family."}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 992760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 990640, "text": "Well, sit down, huh? Come on."}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 995480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 994480, "text": "Come on."}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 999600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 995920, "text": "Now, believe it or not, I really do\nunderstand how you feel."}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 1005380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1000040, "text": "No, you don't. Yeah, I was what you'd\ncall a lonely kind of kid. I was never"}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 1007480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1005380, "text": "invited to the cool parties."}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 1010260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1007760, "text": "Nobody asked me to join the popular\nclubs."}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 1012370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1010890, "text": "Well, I won up on you there."}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 1015510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1012990, "text": "I was asked to join the most popular\nclub in high school."}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 1017370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1016030, "text": "Really? Yeah."}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 1021890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1019710, "text": "Eight of us were selected to go through\nthe initiation."}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 1029210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1022330, "text": "And all we had to do to join was shave\nour heads before he"}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 1031170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1029210, "text": "showed up for the junior prom."}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 1033849, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1032849, "text": "So I did."}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 1041609, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1038290, "text": "And when I walked into the gym, To meet\nmy date."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 1045730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1043569, "text": "You were the only one who'd shaved his\nhead."}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 1050870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1048410, "text": "I was only 16, Harry."}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 1052530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1051530, "text": "And sure myself."}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 1057950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1054570, "text": "Worried like most adolescents about the\nway I looked anyway."}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 1060050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1059050, "text": "And there I stood."}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 1062970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1061970, "text": "Humiliated."}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 1065370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1063290, "text": "In front of what was for me at the time."}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 1067130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1065890, "text": "The whole world."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 1076580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1075340, "text": "And then I wanted to kill them."}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 1081080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1079380, "text": "Just like Bully the Dragon?"}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 1085320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1082080, "text": "Yeah. Only I didn't live happily ever\nafter."}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 1092600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1090920, "text": "Somebody swiped his lunch?"}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 1094540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1093540, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 1096740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1095400, "text": "A long time ago."}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 1099880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1097700, "text": "You can't have my tuna sandwich, mister."}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 1101220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1100140, "text": "Go away, kid, will ya?"}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 1103400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1102400, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 1107570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1104890, "text": "crazy about that smelly fish either."}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 1122850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1121830, "text": "Say, listen, kid."}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 1125190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1124190, "text": "I'm sorry."}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 1129990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1125530, "text": "I appreciate the offer, but I gotta eat\nout of a feed bag until he's healed."}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 1139760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1134720, "text": "See, when he gets hungry, he just has to\nlean over and gobble up with a little"}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 1140760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1139760, "text": "brontosaurus."}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 1142800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1141380, "text": "Brontosaurus just ate plants."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 1144140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1143140, "text": "You're kidding."}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 1146000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1145000, "text": "No, it's true."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 1150580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1146840, "text": "Besides, if he ate up all those guys, he\nwouldn't have anybody to play with."}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 1152720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1150920, "text": "Why would he want to play with them?"}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 1159700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1158260, "text": "Maybe because he was lonely."}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 1161300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1160300, "text": "You think so?"}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 1162760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1161760, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 1165090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1163630, "text": "But I guess it really didn't matter."}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 1168110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1165890, "text": "They were afraid to play with him\nanyway."}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 1172490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1169350, "text": "Oh, you must have been very sad."}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 1174790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1173470, "text": "I sure was."}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 1177310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1175750, "text": "You're not a monster."}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 1195030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1192910, "text": "leave the nice man with the plaster\nhands alone."}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 1198070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1196750, "text": "He's great, Mom."}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 1199830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1198270, "text": "He knows everything."}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 1201349, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1200350, "text": "Is he drunk?"}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 1202950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1201350, "text": "Well, then, he must be."}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 1204170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1203170, "text": "That's right, ma 'am."}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 1205350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1204350, "text": "I'm a bailiff."}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 1213070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1208910, "text": "You'll excuse us. We have to run for our\nlives."}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 1215490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1214490, "text": "I understand."}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 1217570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1216570, "text": "Bye, mister."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 1218930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1217930, "text": "Bye, kid."}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 1227870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1223110, "text": "You know, Bull, I don't think that kid\nis ever going to look a dinosaur or"}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 1229970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1227870, "text": "even people in quite the same way again."}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 1231810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1230810, "text": "What do you mean?"}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 1233050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1231870, "text": "You showed him something."}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 1236470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1233690, "text": "That you can't judge a book by its\ncover."}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 1239730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1238070, "text": "Did you make that up?"}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 1245410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1244410, "text": "Yes."}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 1252910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1248850, "text": "Thanks, Harry. No thanks necessary,\nBull. We're both... Buddies, right? And"}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 1255010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1252910, "text": "buddies take care of each other whenever\nthey can."}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 1258190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1255510, "text": "Then you'll always be there when I need\nyou? You betcha, Bull."}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 1259410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1258410, "text": "Always."}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1263030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1261570, "text": "I have to go to the bathroom."}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1268970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1267970, "text": "Hi,"}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1271230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1270130, "text": "guys. Hi."}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1272930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1271530, "text": "Hiya, big guy. Welcome back."}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1274690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1273330, "text": "I sure missed you, Bull."}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1276010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1275010, "text": "Thanks."}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1277630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1276630, "text": "Guess what?"}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1279810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1277790, "text": "What? I did some more writing."}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1282640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1280510, "text": "Well, Bull, how... How did you write it\nwith your hands and caps?"}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1285460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1283720, "text": "I stuck the pencil up my nostril."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1290440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1287540, "text": "Well, couldn't you have just put the\npencil in between your teeth?"}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1292320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1291120, "text": "After it had been in my nose?"}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1297620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1295620, "text": "Well, why don't you read to us what you\nwrote?"}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1298960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1297960, "text": "Okie dokie."}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1304280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1301440, "text": "This is an introductory poem from the\nbook I wrote."}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1310660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1306200, "text": "Some monsters roar and shake the ground\nwith fury."}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1311890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1310890, "text": "as they tread."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1315170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1312130, "text": "But I never actually met a beast who\ntruly wished me dead."}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1321490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1316050, "text": "Oh, sure, their ugly faces and steely\neyes can scare, but they never seem to"}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1323890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1321490, "text": "more mean than the ferocious teddy bear."}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1330330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1325710, "text": "So I guess it's true, like the covers of\nthe book, of the story, it's only a"}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1337010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1330330, "text": "part. But the monster's face never gives\nyou a clue to the love at any part."}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1346760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1345420, "text": "Bull Shannon just showed up."}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1349220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1346960, "text": "Thanks. What are you going to call your\nbook?"}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1352000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1349900, "text": "The Snake Pit of Chucky's Mind."}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1356380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1354720, "text": "We'll work on titles next."}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1360480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1357220, "text": "Your Honor, Your Honor, you better come\nhere, sir. What's that? Come on, come"}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1361680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1360480, "text": "on. We gotta find Dan."}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1364060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1362560, "text": "Remember that woman he was with?"}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1367280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1364360, "text": "Miriam Brody? Yeah, her psychiatrist\njust called. What?"}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1369520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1367480, "text": "Her psychiatrist just called."}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1373700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1370460, "text": "Apparently, she's suffering from a split\npersonality disorder."}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1380680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1375340, "text": "She can be very deceptive. Oh, come on\nnow. I know Dan fell for it twice, but I"}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1381680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1380680, "text": "don't..."}
